{"version":"context-relations-v1-canary","words":{"case":[{"id":"krdict:14773:1","headword":"안","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"여럿이 모여 의논하거나 살펴보아야 할 항목이나 내용.","englishExpression":"item on the agenda; case","englishDescription":"The item or content to be reviewed or discussed in a meeting, etc.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14773&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:14773:3","headword":"안","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"‘안건’의 뜻을 나타내는 말.","englishExpression":"item on the agenda; case","englishDescription":"A word meaning an 'items on the agenda.'","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14773&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:15654:1","headword":"사건","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"관심이나 주목을 끌 만한 일.","englishExpression":"incident; event; affair; accident; case","englishDescription":"A matter that is worthy of interest or attention.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15654&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:15860:1","headword":"사례","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"이전에 실제로 일어난 예.","englishExpression":"example; case; precedent","englishDescription":"An instance of previous occurrence.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15860&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:28783:2","headword":"격","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"문법에서, 체언이나 체언과 비슷한 말이 문장 내에서 서술어에 대하여 가지는 자격.","englishExpression":"case","englishDescription":"The grammatical status of a substantive, or a similar form, in relation to the predicate of a sentence.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28783&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:31331:1","headword":"겉껍질","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"과일이나 채소 등의 겉을 둘러싸고 있는 것.","engli