ing a sword, gun, glasses, etc.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71358&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:72778:1","headword":"일례","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"하나의 보기. 또는 한 가지의 예.","englishExpression":"example; instance; case","englishDescription":"One example or instance.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72778&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:83233:1","headword":"케이스","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"물건을 넣는 작은 상자나 덮개.","englishExpression":"case; cover","englishDescription":"A small box or pouch which is used to hold or carry an object.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83233&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:91895:8","headword":"일","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 행위를 이루는 동작이나 상태를 이르는 말.","englishExpression":"case","englishDescription":"A word referring to a certain motion or state.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91895&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"connotative":[{"id":"krdict:85609:1","headword":"함축적","partOfSpeech":"determiner","partOfSpeechKo":"관형사","definitionKo":"말이나 글이 속에 어떤 뜻을 담고 있는.","englishExpression":"implicative; connotative; suggestive","englishDescription":"Many meanings or messages being hidden behind a speech or text.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85609&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"dissatisfiedly":[{"id":"krdict:60243:1","headword":"불만스레","partOfSpeech":"adverb","partOfSpeechKo":"부사","definitionKo":"마음에 차지 않아 좋지 않은 느낌이 있게.","englishExpression":"discontentedly; dissatisfiedly","englishDescription":"In a bad feeling due to dissatisfaction with something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60243&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"dragon":[{"id":"krdict:26627:1","headword":"용","partOfSpeech":"