al","englishDescription":"Doing something as a political means or method.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70892&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:76066:1","headword":"정략적","partOfSpeech":"determiner","partOfSpeechKo":"관형사","definitionKo":"정치적인 책략을 목적으로 하는.","englishExpression":"political","englishDescription":"Being as a political stratagem.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76066&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"resign":[{"id":"krdict:15735:3","headword":"물러나다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"하던 일이나 자리를 내놓고 나오다.","englishExpression":"withdraw; retire; resign","englishDescription":"To give up what one is doing or position one is holding, and leave.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15735&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:38888:3","headword":"나앉다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"하던 일을 그만두거나 원래의 직책에서 물러나다.","englishExpression":"quit; resign","englishDescription":"To quit one's job or resign from one's position.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38888&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:56200:3","headword":"물러가다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"하고 있던 일, 차지하고 있던 자리나 지위 등을 내놓고 떠나다.","englishExpression":"withdraw; retire; resign","englishDescription":"To give up what one is doing,  or a place or position one is holding, and leave.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56200&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:56201:2","headword":"물러서다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"하고 있던 일, 차지하고 있던 자리나 지위 등을 내놓다.","englishExpression":"withdraw; retire; resign","englishDescription":"To give up what one is doing,  or a place or position one is holding.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56201&nation=eng&nati